  "caveats": [
    "The released 3D prediction data are generated by authors, not inference performed on Nitro; historical model versions and public training contamination unknown.",
    "Mechanical category selection exploratory and may combine vehicles, robotics, tools and electronics; geometry defects are human labels, not numerical engineering physics.",
    "Only 99 golden assets common to all five baseline models, human labels are adjudicated but nonzero human disagreement and rare categories.",
    "W3C ACT contains author-scripted and image-background cases; scripts excluded and proxy blocks network to protect system.",
    "Small cropped target screenshots may remove important context for ScreenVLM; no extrapolation to normal full-page parsing.",
    "NVIDIA physical plausibility video head reports approximately 80.52% bad recall and 31.33% good rejection on its heldout same-generator set, H100, not validated locally on machinery videos."
  ],
  "next_required": [
    "Independent clean and physically impossible REAL mechanical CAD and render examples beyond generative text-to-3D source labels, with source geometry and multiview captures",
